  "objectives": [
    "Describe the apparent path of Mars across the night sky during a retrograde episode.",
    "Explain how apparent retrograde motion is a natural consequence of Earth overtaking a slower-moving outer planet.",
    "Compare geocentric epicycles with heliocentric mechanics on grounds of simplicity and physical accuracy.",
    "Determine how a planet's orbital distance from Earth impacts the angular size of its retrograde loop."
