                  "componentType": "textMeshPro",
                  "text": "Geocentric Solution: Epicycles",
                  "color": [
                    1,
                    0.4,
                    0.4,
                    1
                  ],
                  "fontSize": 32,
                  "wrapText": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "changeMeaning": "Display the geocentric model's mechanical explanation utilizing an epicycle gear overlay.",
          "narration": "To explain this bizarre looping behavior under an Earth-centered, or geocentric, model, ancient astronomers like Ptolemy had to propose complex 'epicycles'\u2014circles riding upon larger circles. While mathematically clever, it was highly unnatural."
        }
      ]
